---
/**
 * Variant 6: Ultra Luxury / Exclusive
 * Extremely high-end, expensive look with gold accents and refined typography
 */
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Variante 6 - Exklusiv | Mobile Kinderosteopathie Leipzig</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --color-gold: #c9a962;
      --color-gold-light: #d4ba7a;
      --color-gold-dark: #a8893d;

      --color-navy: #0a1628;
      --color-navy-light: #132238;
      --color-navy-dark: #060d18;

      --color-cream: #f9f7f3;
      --color-cream-dark: #ebe7df;

      --color-text-light: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      --color-text-muted: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);

      --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
      --font-sans: 'Montserrat', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      color: var(--color-text-light);
      background: var(--color-navy);
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 32px;
    }

    /* Decorative line */
    .gold-line {
      width: 60px;
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--color-gold), transparent);
    }

    /* Header */
    .header {
      padding: 32px 0;
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 50;
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 48px;
    }

    .nav a {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }

    .nav a:hover {
      color: var(--color-gold);
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    .btn-gold {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--color-gold);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
    }

    .btn-gold:hover {
      background: var(--color-gold);
      color: var(--color-navy);
    }

    .btn-gold-solid {
      background: var(--color-gold);
      color: var(--color-navy);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
    }

    .btn-gold-solid:hover {
      background: var(--color-gold-light);
      border-color: var(--color-gold-light);
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 50%, rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.03) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 20%, rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.02) 0%, transparent 40%);
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 100px;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-content {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .hero-label {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      color: var(--color-gold);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 4rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .hero h1 em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--color-gold);
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      max-width: 450px;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .hero-visual {
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-image-frame {
      position: relative;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .hero-image-frame::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
      opacity: 0.3;
    }

    .hero-image-frame::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 40px;
      left: 40px;
      right: -20px;
      bottom: -20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
      opacity: 0.15;
    }

    .hero-image {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 3/4;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: brightness(0.9) contrast(1.05);
    }

    /* Stats */
    .stats-section {
      padding: 100px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.1);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.1);
    }

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 64px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-item {
      position: relative;
    }

    .stat-item::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      right: 0;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      width: 1px;
      height: 60px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.3), transparent);
    }

    .stat-item:last-child::after {
      display: none;
    }

    .stat-number {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--color-gold);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    /* Philosophy Section */
    .philosophy-section {
      padding: 140px 0;
      background: var(--color-navy-light);
      position: relative;
    }

    .philosophy-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 100px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .philosophy-images {
      position: relative;
    }

    .philosophy-image-1 {
      width: 70%;
      aspect-ratio: 3/4;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .philosophy-image-1 img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: brightness(0.85);
    }

    .philosophy-image-2 {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -40px;
      right: 0;
      width: 55%;
      aspect-ratio: 4/3;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 8px solid var(--color-navy-light);
    }

    .philosophy-image-2 img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: brightness(0.85);
    }

    .philosophy-content {
      padding-left: 40px;
    }

    .section-label {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      color: var(--color-gold);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .philosophy-content h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 2.75rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .philosophy-content p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .signature {
      margin-top: 48px;
      padding-top: 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.2);
    }

    .signature-name {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .signature-title {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-gold);
    }

    /* Services Preview */
    .services-section {
      padding: 140px 0;
      background: var(--color-navy);
    }

    .services-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 80px;
    }

    .services-header h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 2.75rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 48px;
    }

    .service-card {
      padding: 48px 40px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.15);
      text-align: center;
      transition: all 0.4s ease;
      position: relative;
    }

    .service-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--color-gold);
      transform: scaleX(0);
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }

    .service-card:hover {
      background: rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.03);
      border-color: rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.3);
    }

    .service-card:hover::before {
      transform: scaleX(1);
    }

    .service-icon {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--color-gold);
    }

    .service-icon svg {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      stroke-width: 1;
    }

    .service-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .service-card p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    /* CTA */
    .cta-section {
      padding: 140px 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-gold-dark) 0%, var(--color-gold) 100%);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .cta-section::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      right: -25%;
      width: 80%;
      height: 200%;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
    }

    .cta-content {
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .cta-content h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--color-navy);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .cta-content p {
      color: var(--color-navy);
      opacity: 0.8;
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .btn-dark {
      background: var(--color-navy);
      color: var(--color-cream);
      border: none;
    }

    .btn-dark:hover {
      background: var(--color-navy-dark);
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
      background: var(--color-navy-dark);
      padding: 80px 0 40px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.1);
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 80px;
      margin-bottom: 64px;
    }

    .footer-brand h4 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .footer-brand p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .footer h5 {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-gold);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .footer-links li {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: var(--color-gold);
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.1);
      padding-top: 40px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .footer-copy {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    /* Back link */
    .back-link {
      position: fixed;
      top: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      background: var(--color-gold);
      color: var(--color-navy);
      padding: 12px 24px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      z-index: 100;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      background: var(--color-gold-light);
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 64px; }
      .hero-visual { order: -1; max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .hero { padding-top: 120px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 3rem; }
      .philosophy-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 64px; }
      .philosophy-content { padding-left: 0; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .nav { display: none; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
      .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
      .stat-item::after { display: none; }
      .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
      .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; text-align: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a href="/project/designs" class="back-link">← Alle Varianten</a>

  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a href="#" class="logo">Susanne Hoppe</a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="#">Home</a>
        <a href="#">Philosophie</a>
        <a href="#">Leistungen</a>
        <a href="#">Kontakt</a>
      </nav>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-gold">Termin vereinbaren</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <div class="hero-label">
            <span class="gold-line"></span>
            Mobile Kinderosteopathie
          </div>
          <h1>Die Kunst der <em>sanften</em> Berührung</h1>
          <p>
            Exklusive osteopathische Behandlung für Ihr Kind –
            mit höchster Sorgfalt und über zwei Jahrzehnten Expertise.
            In der Geborgenheit Ihres Zuhauses.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-gold-solid">Beratungsgespräch</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-gold">Mehr erfahren</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual">
          <div class="hero-image-frame">
            <div class="hero-image">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581579438747-1dc8d17bbce4?w=600&h=800&fit=crop" alt="Kinderosteopathie" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <section class="stats-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">20+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Jahre Expertise</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">100%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Persönliche Betreuung</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-number">∞</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Hingabe & Sorgfalt</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Philosophy -->
  <section class="philosophy-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="philosophy-grid">
        <div class="philosophy-images">
          <div class="philosophy-image-1">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?w=500&h=650&fit=crop&crop=face" alt="Susanne Hoppe" />
          </div>
          <div class="philosophy-image-2">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587654780291-39c9404d746b?w=400&h=300&fit=crop" alt="Behandlung" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-content">
          <div class="section-label">
            <span class="gold-line"></span>
            Meine Philosophie
          </div>
          <h2>Jedem Kind gebührt die höchste Aufmerksamkeit</h2>
          <p>
            In über zwei Jahrzehnten therapeutischer Arbeit habe ich gelernt,
            dass wahre Heilung Zeit, Raum und absolute Präsenz erfordert.
          </p>
          <p>
            Deshalb komme ich zu Ihnen – in die vertraute Umgebung Ihres Zuhauses,
            wo Ihr Kind sich sicher fühlt und ich meine volle Aufmerksamkeit
            der Behandlung widmen kann.
          </p>
          <div class="signature">
            <div class="signature-name">Susanne Hoppe</div>
            <div class="signature-title">Kinder-Osteopathin & Physiotherapeutin</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services -->
  <section class="services-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="services-header">
        <div class="section-label" style="justify-content: center;">
          <span class="gold-line"></span>
          Leistungen
          <span class="gold-line"></span>
        </div>
        <h2>Maßgeschneiderte Behandlung</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Hausbesuch</h3>
          <p>Exklusive Behandlung in der Geborgenheit Ihres Zuhauses – ohne Anfahrtsstress, ohne Wartezeiten.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Sanfte Osteopathie</h3>
          <p>Behutsame Techniken, perfekt abgestimmt auf die individuellen Bedürfnisse Ihres Kindes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Flexible Termine</h3>
          <p>Terminvereinbarung nach Ihren Wünschen – angepasst an den Rhythmus Ihrer Familie.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>Beginnen Sie die Reise</h2>
        <p>
          Ich freue mich auf ein persönliches Gespräch, um die beste
          Behandlung für Ihr Kind zu planen.
        </p>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-dark">Kontakt aufnehmen</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-brand">
          <h4>Susanne Hoppe</h4>
          <p>
            Mobile Kinderosteopathie in Leipzig.<br>
            Exklusive Behandlung bei Ihnen zuhause.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h5>Navigation</h5>
          <ul class="footer-links">
            <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Philosophie</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Leistungen</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Kontakt</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h5>Rechtliches</h5>
          <ul class="footer-links">
            <li><a href="#">Impressum</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Datenschutz</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <div class="footer-copy">
          © 2025 Susanne Hoppe. Alle Rechte vorbehalten.
        </div>
        <div class="gold-line" style="width: 100px;"></div>
